  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Danish support to to the Office of the Special Representative of the Secretary-General on Sexual Violence in Conflict (O-SRSG-SVC)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Danish support to the Office of the Special Representative of the Secretary-General on Sexual Violence in Conflict (O-SRSG-SVC), which aims to strengthen the office&apos;s research, advocacy and participation in sanctions committees and other partnerships that can promote accountability in relation to sexual violence in conflict globally.</narrative>
  </description>
